New "Organic Engine" tab on the NPC Simulator page, rendered from the API's field
schema (GET /admin/npc/organic/schema) so every engine setting is editable with its
label, help text, range, unit and "applies" tag (instantly / next round / settlement).
Status bar shows the engine mode with a live organic ⇄ legacy switch, the engine
heartbeat and "saved vN / engine applied vN". Unsaved fields are marked, per-field
server validation errors are shown inline, defaults are one click away.
"Live round" polls the engine telemetry every second (lead target, tiers, NPC/real
trade counts, sim volume, pot bar, projection, final injection, recent NPC trades);
"Round audits" lists settled rounds with the settlement invariants and the lock /
injection record. Legacy-only tabs are labelled.

